  "observations": [
    "Scoped paths and retained content digests resolved the exact source, pattern, rule, placement, study and check; a duplicate local rule ID resolved independently in a second scope.",
    "The active-hold calculation reproduced two seconds at two units per second and one second at four units per second. The unexecuted playtest contained target conditions and an expectation.",
    "The traced fixture decision created one authoritative tuning revision for the accepted proposal and retained a separate rejection. The repeat read resolved the applied proposal at the current tuning revision without a second write.",
    "A competing proposal from the same base remained available for reconciliation. The affected placement moved to review and the historical check still resolved to its original rule and environment."
